---
import "~/assets/style/selection.scss";

import Layout from "~/layouts/Layout.astro";
import HomeCard from "~/components/HomeCard.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="py-8 mx-auto xl:w-main">
    <div class="xl:grid xl:grid-flow-row-dense xl:grid-cols-3 xl:gap-4">
      <HomeCard classNames={{ container: "xl:col-span-2" }} link="/notes/react">
        <h2 class="relative z-10 mb-12 text-3xl text-black">
          <span class="selection-prefix"></span>
          <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-red">React 从入门到放弃</span>
          <span class="selection-suffix"></span>
        </h2>
        <p>Hooks: The thing that makes React simpler... by making it more complicated first.</p>
        <br />
        <p>React: Write once, rerender forever</p>
        <p>"Frontend developers: Why is this component re-rendering? <br/> React: 🤷‍♂️ It’s a feature, not a bug."</p>
      </HomeCard>

      <HomeCard classNames={{ container: 'xl:row-span-2' }} link="/notes/javascript">
        <p class="mt-4 mb-16">JavaScript: The only language where [] + [] equals an empty string, and we’re all fine with it.</p>
        <div class="relative z-10 mb-4 text-black">
          <h2 class="mb-8 text-2xl">
            <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-yellow selection-prefix">大家都知道的 JavaScript</span>
          </h2>

          <h4 class="inline-block px-1 mb-4 font-bold rounded-lg bg-theme-yellow">Atwood's Law</h4>
          <br />
          <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-yellow">Any application that can be written in JavaScript, will eventually be written in JavaScript.</span>
          <span class="selection-suffix"></span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-24 mb-2">
          JavaScript is like a magician: one minute it’s undefined, the next minute it’s working perfectly... and no one knows why.
        </p>

        <p>
          Frontend in JavaScript: Write once, debug everywhere.
        </p>
      </HomeCard>

      <HomeCard link="/notes/css">
        <p class="mb-4">CSS: The art of spending hours aligning a button... only to find it breaks in Internet</p>
        <p class="mb-8">"CSS: Centering a div is easy! <br />Also CSS: Good luck figuring out how."</p>
        <div class="relative z-10 text-black">
          <h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl">
            <span class="selection-prefix"></span>
            <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-blue">CSS 魔法</span>
          </h2>

          <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-blue selection-suffix">前端真正的护城河</span>
        </div>
      </HomeCard>

      <HomeCard link="/notes/fullstack">
        <div class="relative z-10 mb-4 text-black">
          <h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl">
            <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-green selection-prefix">全干工程师养成计划</span>
          </h2>

          <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-green">"Full Stack Developer: Writes APIs that nobody uses and CSS that nobody understands."</span>
          <span class="selection-suffix"></span>
        </div>

        <p>"Full Stack Developer's prayer: <br />'Please let my frontend talk to my backend without a CORS error today.' Amen."</p>
      </HomeCard>

      <div class="col-span-3 xl:grid xl:grid-cols-2 xl:gap-4">
        <HomeCard link="/notes/tools">
          <div class="relative z-10 mb-4 text-black">
            <h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl">
              <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-purple selection-prefix">四次元口袋</span>
            </h2>

            <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-purple">"你知道的好多，我也能像你一样厉害吗？"</span>
            <span class="selection-suffix"></span>
          </div>

          <p>"Me: I know React, Vue, Svelte, Tailwind, Webpack, Vite, Rspack, and Rust!"</p>
          <p>"Recruiter: Do you have 5 years of enterprise experience with PHP?"</p>
        </HomeCard>

        <HomeCard link="/notes/ai">
          <p>"AI can replace artists, writers, and programmers. But not the guy who approves budgets."</p>

          <div class="relative z-10 mt-4 text-black">
            <h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl">
              <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-pink selection-prefix">AI 观察日记</span>
            </h2>

            <p class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-pink">"AI: I can generate art, music, and even code!" </p>
            <br />
            <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-pink selection-suffix">"Me: Can you generate me a job?"</span>
          </div>
        </HomeCard>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
